Z||000004||Pike||10-06-2001||11:17 PM||||I ride a 2001 929 RRRRRRRRRRR. I'm a little disappointed in available power. I thinl I have 150 at the crank and what I need is to have it at the wheel. I'm a big guy and I like to run hard through the corners a little faster than the 929 wants to go. I rode a friends 1100XX and I think that is where I;m going next with full stage 6 mods. But I will say this... It's a comfortable ride at 190. Willow Springs is less than a mile from my house...Yep! I live in the "sticks".||||reg||1
